{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56784","headline":"吴彩鸾作越王山诗（题拟） · 不详","name":"吴彩鸾作越王山诗（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一斑与两斑，引入越王山。\n世数今逃尽，烟萝得再还。\n箫声宜露滴，鹤翅向云间。\n一粒仙人药，服之能驻颜。\n（见宋陈元靓《岁时广记》卷三十二引裴鉶《传奇》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56784.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56784","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}